{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://uutils.org",
    "description": [
      "启动 COMMAND，超时仍在运行时杀掉它"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--foreground",
      "alias": [
        "-f"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-f, --foreground"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "非直接从 shell 提示符运行 timeout 时，允许 COMMAND 从 TTY 读取并接收 TTY 信号；此模式下 COMMAND 的子进程不会超时"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--kill-after",
      "alias": [
        "-k"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-k, --kill-after <KILL-AFTER>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "发送初始信号后经过这么久 COMMAND 仍在运行，也发送 KILL 信号"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--preserve-status",
      "alias": [
        "-p"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-p, --preserve-status"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "即使命令超时，也以与 COMMAND 相同的状态退出"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--signal",
      "alias": [
        "-s"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-s, --signal <SIGNAL>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "指定超时时发送的信号；SIGNAL 可以是 HUP 这样的名称或数字；信号列表见 kill -l"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--verbose",
      "alias": [
        "-v"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-v, --verbose"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "向 stderr 诊断超时时发送的信号"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--version",
      "alias": [
        "-V"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-V, --version"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印版本"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "global_option": [
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "alias": [
        "-h"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-h, --help"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印帮助"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
